    {
      "id": "BgZBJk1pCUVxfmElicCtq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1929.2498694407104,
      "y": 692.1493944859707,
      "width": 960.8853552308836,
      "height": 165.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1067100023,
      "version": 740,
      "versionNonce": 638620073,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782746844156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For (1, 2) and (2, 2), we check whether the east–west (EW)\nconnection is open. If EW = (1, 1), the vertex has a north (N)\nbranch. If EW = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a north (N)\nbranch.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For (1, 2) and (2, 2), we check whether the east–west (EW) connection is open. If EW = (1, 1), the vertex has a north (N) branch. If EW = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a north (N) branch.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "XrY7TveUAhPuAp9K4bI18",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1926.3381199958235,
      "y": 878.9791454621185,
      "width": 965.6345499216611,
      "height": 165.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1406754745,
      "version": 692,
      "versionNonce": 192894409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782746871658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For (1, 2) and (1, 3), we check whether the south–north (SN)\nconnection is open. If SN = (1, 1), the vertex has a west (W)\nbranch. If SN = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a west (W)\nbranch.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For (1, 2) and (1, 3), we check whether the south–north (SN) connection is open. If SN = (1, 1), the vertex has a west (W) branch. If SN = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a west (W) branch.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
