    {
      "id": "dAzidRmpPToNkvjVicU5d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1966.204806815494,
      "y": 1192.435498580211,
      "width": 960.8853552308836,
      "height": 165.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 380205769,
      "version": 900,
      "versionNonce": 515147145,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782746914069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For (2, 3) and (2, 2), we check whether the north–south (NS)\nconnection is open. If NS = (1, 1), the vertex has an east (E)\nbranch. If NS = (0, 0), the vertex does not have an east (E)\nbranch.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For (2, 3) and (2, 2), we check whether the north–south (NS) connection is open. If NS = (1, 1), the vertex has an east (E) branch. If NS = (0, 0), the vertex does not have an east (E) branch.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "crmlyRjq8HXJVpS9UmIpc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1966.3156393016357,
      "y": 1377.761252604285,
      "width": 960.8853552308836,
      "height": 165.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1883209767,
      "version": 1095,
      "versionNonce": 2134697097,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782746937505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For (2, 3) and (1, 3), we check whether the west–east (WE)\nconnection is open. If WE = (1, 1), the vertex has a south (S)\nbranch. If WE = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a south (S)\nbranch.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For (2, 3) and (1, 3), we check whether the west–east (WE) connection is open. If WE = (1, 1), the vertex has a south (S) branch. If WE = (0, 0), the vertex does not have a south (S) branch.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
